&lt;div class=&quot;position-header&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;position-header&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;position-header&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;type&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;type&quot;&gt;STUTTGART // AB SOFORT&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;position-header&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;type&quot;&gt;Über Avi Medical&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir finden Allgemeinmedizin ist noch nicht im 21. Jahrhundert ankommen und möchten das in unseren Praxen ändern. Wie genau? Modernes und einladendes Praxisdesign, entwickelt durch unserer eigenes Architektenteam. Weniger Administration durch konsequente Digitalisierung bspw. automatische Terminbuchung über die App ohne ständiges Telefonieren. Eine team-basierte Kultur, aus Kolleg:innen, die auf gleicher Wellenlänge sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hier bekommst du einen Eindruck von deinen zukünftigen Kolleg:innen: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.avimedical.com/team&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.avimedical.com/team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gehalt: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Attraktives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;und übertarifliches Gehaltspaket inklusive Unternehmensanteilen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilität:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; flexible Arbeitszeitmodelle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilität: &lt;/strong&gt;Fahrkarte für den ÖPNV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Umfassendes und sehr kostengünstiges Sport- und Wellnessangebot (Fitness, Yoga, Schwimmen u.v.m.) über&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://egym-wellpass.com/mitarbeitende/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;EGYM Wellpass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterbildungsbudget:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; 1.000 €/Jahr für deine berufliche und fachliche Weiterbildung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Urlaub: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;30 Tage bezahlter Urlaub pro Jahr + 1 zusätzlicher freier Tag an deinem Geburtstag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essenszuschuss:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Wir übernehmen deine Essensausgaben von bis zu 50€/Monat (netto) über unseren Partner Hrmony&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familie:&lt;/strong&gt; 500€ Bonus (brutto) pro Kind und Jahr (“KITA” - Bonus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unser Standort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/XghKSJR1ekXp27QX8&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Feuerbach:&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Grazer Str. 22, 70469 Stuttgart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ganzheitliche Patient:innenbetreuung: organisatorisch und medizinisch (EKG, Lungenfunktion, Ergometrie, Labor, Blutentnahmen). Im Einzelfall schulen und bilden wir gerne weiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bedienung des modernen und komplett digitalen Praxissystem (inkl. Schulung zu Beginn)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abrechnung von Praxisleistungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Füreinander im Team da sein &amp;amp; sich helfen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du mitbringst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Medizinische:r Fachangestellte:r&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einfühlsamkeit, Patientenorientierung und Freude am Umgang mit Menschen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse an Fort- und Weiterbildung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lust neue Ideen umzusetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und basis Englisch-Kenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewirb dich jetzt und gestalte gemeinsam mit uns die Hausarztpraxis der Zukunft!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

balderton-avi-medical:greenhouse:4721294.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;Munich&amp;nbsp; // Full-Time // Starting ASAP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Administrator &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(all genders, Senior)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Avi&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are on a mission to elevate the patient experience and provide the best possible primary care by combining technology with a human touch. Avi Medical runs patient-centric, tech-enabled medical practices that provide a convenient, personalized and holistic digital and physical patient experience unlike regular general practitioners. We employ our medical doctors and provide them a 21st century work environment that enables them to deliver the best care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Senior System Administrator, you will be the backbone of our operational technology, ensuring a secure, reliable, and highly available IT environment across our practices and corporate infrastructure. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your key responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Setup, maintain, and secure communication infrastructure, including IP Telephony, VPNs (e.g., Meraki VPN), and Mobile Device Management (MDM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice IT:&lt;/strong&gt; Configure, deploy, and maintain medical equipment and all necessary IT devices within our medical practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage critical data transfer and communication channels, ensuring strict compliance with regulatory bodies like gematik and HÄVG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Administer and secure our cloud identity and access management systems, including Google Workspace, Central Identity Provider (IdP), and authentication platforms like Okta and JumpCloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Availability &amp;amp; Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement strategies to ensure and maintain high system availability, proactively monitoring system health and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive efficiency by automating provisioning, configuration management, and setup processes as much as possible to ensure scalability and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage endpoint security solutions, such as Crowdstrike, and maintain operating systems like Windows Server, Debian Linux, and Oracle Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Software &amp;amp; Tool-Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Networking/VPN: Meraki VPN, TailScale; Identity &amp;amp; Access: JumpCloud, Google Workspace, Okta; Security: Crowdstrike, eye.Security; Operating Systems: Windows Server, Debian Linux, Oracle Linux; Medical/Compliance: TI vHSK, KV Connect, KIM; Cloud Platform: Google Cloud, Hetzner&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After 3 months&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll have immersed yourself in our company culture, understood our current infrastructure, and established strong relationships with key stakeholders. You&#39;ll begin leading the maintenance and operation of critical communication systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After 6 months&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll have a solid grasp of the healthcare regulatory sector and our specific compliance requirements. You&#39;ll have successfully led the deployment or upgrade of a key practice IT system, showcasing your ability to drive efficiency and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After 12 months&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be fully adapted to our dynamic environment and recognized as a critical strategic partner. You&#39;ll have made significant strides in optimizing our automated provisioning and configuration processes, with a track record of successful projects that ensure our platforms are scalable and highly secure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills &amp;amp; qualifications to help you succeed in this role are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3-5 years of professional experience in Systems Administration or Infrastructure engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven proficiency in managing complex, multi-site network infrastructure, including VPN and firewall technologies (e.g., Meraki, WireGuard, TailScale).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in administering modern Identity and Access Management (IAM) systems (e.g., Okta, JumpCloud) and cloud administration (Google Workspace, Google Cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command-line skills in a Linux environment (Debian/Oracle) and experience with Windows Server administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulatory compliance and security standards in a highly regulated industry; familiarity with gematik or HÄVG communication protocols is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to automate system tasks using scripting languages (e.g., Bash, Python) and configuration management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and initiative to fix problems, ensuring high availability and reliability of critical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to collaborate effectively across clinical and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in German&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On the personal side you ideally describe yourself as the following&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner, open to diving into and understanding diverse topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient, able to navigate challenging situations with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I am kind!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The salary range projected is between 67.000€ and 83.000€ gross per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to remove barriers, eliminate discrimination, and ensure equal opportunity through our transparent recruitment process. We are open to all groups of people without regard to age, color, national origin, race, religion, gender, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or expression, marital status, or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

balderton-graphcore:greenhouse:849141100.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Graphcore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Graphcore, we’re building the future of AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of semiconductor, software and AI experts, with deep experience in creating the complete AI compute stack - from silicon and software to infrastructure at datacenter scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, backed by significant long-term investment, we are delivering key technology into the fast-growing SoftBank AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet the vast and exciting AI opportunity, Graphcore is expanding its teams around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are bringing together the brightest minds to solve the toughest problems, in a place where everyone has the opportunity to make an impact on the company, our products and the future of artificial intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Director of Silicon Logical Design to lead and scale our Logical Design&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;within the Silicon department. This role is accountable for the overall strategy, technical direction, execution&amp;nbsp;quality&amp;nbsp;and team development for&amp;nbsp;Graphcores&amp;nbsp;microarchitecture and RTL design efforts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
