gaingels-mark43:greenhouse:7931914.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the country in which the role is being hired. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment visa at this time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mark43’s mission is to empower communities and their governments with&amp;nbsp;new technologies&amp;nbsp;that improve the safety and quality of life for all. We build powerful, scalable, and elegant software that&amp;nbsp;sets&amp;nbsp;a new standard for the tools upon which our first responders rely. Our users are diverse, and we are therefore committed to embracing diversity of thought and experience within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for an&amp;nbsp;Architect&amp;nbsp;who specializes in Records Management System (RMS) products and workflows to join our&amp;nbsp;Product Architecture&amp;nbsp;team.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a highly customer-facing, delivery-oriented role responsible for overseeing configuration, implementation, and business process analysis across public safety agencies. You will&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;in a consultative and technical capacity, supporting the full lifecycle of RMS delivery,&amp;nbsp;from solution design and application setup through training, launch, and adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll work across a variety of products such as Reporting, Case Management, Evidence, and Warrants, ensuring that product features, workflows, and technical configurations are effectively defined, implemented, and adopted. This position requires at least 50%&amp;nbsp;travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
