&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u0gwos&quot; data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4874&quot;&gt;Candidates will complete a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4783&quot; data-end=&quot;4820&quot;&gt;practical payroll assessment/test&lt;/strong&gt; to evaluate hands-on payroll knowledge and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
