&lt;p data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking a compassionate and dependable Certified Home Health Aide to provide one on one care for a client living in Somerset County. This role offers consistent weekend afternoon hours and the opportunity to build a meaningful connection while helping a client remain safe, comfortable, and independent at home.&lt;/p&gt;
